{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"dce211d9175610e5f41aab81449174b619c0a0c3403fcf9ef9d3082347edf6ab","digest":{"component_or_area":"config schema and deprecation registry","key_entities":["jira.resolved_statuses","reconciler.resolved_statuses","REBAR_JIRA_RESOLVED_STATUSES","REBAR_RECONCILER_RESOLVED_STATUSES","src/rebar/_config_schema.py","src/rebar/_deprecations.py","adapters/jira/probe.py","_as_str_list","ReconcilerConfig","JiraConfig","docs/config.md","docs/user-guide.md"],"problem_keywords":["config removal","deprecated keys","resolved_statuses","tombstone registry","operator sign-off"],"propositions":["The deprecated jira.resolved_statuses and reconciler.resolved_statuses config keys are inert (read by nothing) and must be hard-removed with operator approval.","Both schema fields and their _as_str_list coercers must be deleted from _config_schema.py, and warn-class tombstones added to _deprecations.py for backward compatibility.","The auto-derived environment variable twins (REBAR_JIRA_RESOLVED_STATUSES and REBAR_RECONCILER_RESOLVED_STATUSES) must also be tombstoned with warn severity.","Config and documentation references including # read-via: markers, docs/config.md, docs/user-guide.md, and release notes must be updated or removed.","All local CI gates (check_* suite, generators, lint, typecheck) and pytest must pass with no orphaned markers or module-size violations."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787542800779803001,"uuid":"2ec0ea6f-5b02-4895-a372-ef92412c92e3"}